{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_370","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"cd \\\"D:\\\\tmp\\\\rsi-tf0604-run5\\\\trials\\\\tf-0291-g03-baseline-1\\\\agent\\\"; Get-Content scripts/lib/trace-to-eval-sample.d.mts; \\\"==== doc ====\\\"; Get-Content docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/g03-trace-to-eval-sample.md\"","aggregated_output":"export const TRACE_TO_EVAL_SCHEMA: \"clawx.trace-to-eval.v1\";\r\nexport type TraceOutcome = \"failure\" | \"success\" | \"refusal\" | \"cancelled\";\r\nexport type TraceReproducerKind = \"scenario\" | \"route\" | \"command-id\";\r\nexport type TraceReproducer = { kind: TraceReproducerKind; ref: string };\r\nexport type RedactedFailureTrace = {\r\n  runId: string;\r\n  createdAt: string;\r\n  outcome: TraceOutcome;\r\n  reproducer: TraceReproducer;\r\n  signature: string;\r\n  attempt?: number;\r\n};\r\nexport type EvalSample = {\r\n  schema: typeof TRACE_TO_EVAL_SCHEMA;\r\n  id: string;\r\n  sourceRunId: string;\r\n  createdAt: string;\r\n  sourceOutcome: TraceOutcome;\r\n  expected: { \"before-fix\": \"pass\" | \"fail\"; \"after-fix\": \"pass\" | \"fail\" };\r\n  reproducer: TraceReproducer;\r\n  selector: { runId: string; attempt: number };\r\n  digest: string;\r\n};\r\nexport type EvalSampleDiagnostic = { code: string; message: string };\r\nexport type EvalSampleResult =\r\n  | { ok: true; sample: EvalSample; diagnostics: [] }\r\n  | { ok: false; diagnostics: EvalSampleDiagnostic[] };\r\nexport function traceToEvalSample(trace: unknown): EvalSampleResult;\r\nexport function traceToEvalSamples(traces: readonly unknown[]): {\r\n  schema: typeof TRACE_TO_EVAL_SCHEMA;\r\n  samples: EvalSample[];\r\n  rejected: Array<{ runId: string | null; diagnostics: EvalSampleDiagnostic[] }>;\r\n};\r\n==== doc ====\r\n# G03：脱敏失败轨迹 → 可复跑评测样例\r\n\r\n日期：2026-10-13（Asia/Shanghai）。包码：G03（TF-0291）。真实 provider 调用：无。\r\n\r\n## 链路\r\n\r\n`scripts/lib/trace-to-eval-sample.mjs`：\r\n\r\n- `traceToEvalSample(trace)`：把一条脱敏轨迹转成样例；`expected = { before-fix: fail|pass, after-fix: pass }`（failure 轨迹 before-fix=fail，其余保持 pass）。\r\n- `traceToEvalSamples(traces)`：显式触发批处理（仅调用方选定轨迹；可对应最近 7 天 runIds），逐条留 rejected 诊断。\r\n\r\n## 约束\r\n\r\n- **有界 reproducer**：`kind ∈ { scenario, route, command-id }`；不是 shell 指令。\r\n- **selector 可定位**：`{ runId, attempt }` 供 replay。\r\n- **确定性**：样例含 digest（同输入同 digest）。\r\n- **脱敏闸门**：出现 `prompt/messages/body/authorization/apiKey/headers` 或 `sk-/phc_/ghp_/AKIA/私钥` 等即拒绝整条（`trace-not-redacted`），不写样例。\r\n- **显式触发**：不做定时 automation/daemon；不删原始证据。\r\n\r\n## 实测\r\n\r\n| 断言 | 结果 |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| failure 轨迹 → before-fix fail / after-fix pass；digest 确定 | ✅ |\r\n| success/refusal/cancelled → pass | ✅ |\r\n| raw prompt 或密钥 → 整条拒绝 | ✅ |\r\n| 非有界 reproducer（shell）→ 拒绝 | ✅ |\r\n| 批处理逐条留 rejected 诊断 | ✅ |\r\n| 缺字段 / 非法 outcome → 拒绝 | ✅ |\r\n\r\n## 残余（residual）\r\n\r\n- 本包提供转换器；把它接到具体 trace 存储/runner 属集成层。\r\n- 不新建 scenario registry/daemon/定时任务；不改默认值/锁/approval；非真人证据。\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
